# A refill below the target: fund Saving again, raise the target, refill on
# this computer, and Spending reaches the target.
expect-slow This computer
click Receive
expect-within 120 bcrt1
save-text bcrt1 saving-address-2.txt
# The script pays 0.005 BTC to it and mines.
shot address
close-dialog
expect-within 180 0.0050 BTC
action app.settings
expect Saving wallet
expect-not Anonymity target
expect-not Budget (sat per month)
type "Target (BTC)" 0.011
wait 800
click Back
click Spending
expect of 0.011 target
expect Refill from Saving
shot below-target
click Refill from Saving
expect-slow Refill Spending
expect Confirm on This computer
expect from Saving · fee
shot dialog
click Confirm on This computer
expect Refill started
expect-slow Refill sent
click Saving
expect Refill → Spending
shot refilled
click Spending
# Once credited, Spending is at its target and no refill is offered.
expect-within 400 for spending
expect-not Refill from Saving
shot refill-arrived
